$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM cis-(3-Hydroxycyclohexyl)[(4-methoxymethoxy)phenyl]carbamic Acid Phenyl
Ester (35a). i-Pr2NEt (0.24 mL, 1.40 mmol) and PhOCOCl (0.18 mL, 1.40
mmol) were added in that order to a stirred solution of cis-35 (major
isomer) (294 mg, 1.18 mmol) in CH2Cl2 (6 mL). Stirring was continued for
5 h, water was then added, and the mixture was extracted with CHCl3. The
combined organic extracts were washed with brine, dried (Na2SO4), and
evaporated. Flash chromatography of the residue over silica gel, using
3:7 EtOAc-hexane, gave 35a (397 mg) as an oil:
cis-(3-Hydroxycyclohexyl)[(4-methoxymethoxy)phenyl]carbamic Acid Phenyl
Ester (35a), yield 91% FTIR (CH2Cl2 cast) 3430, 2934, 1716, 1510 cm-1; 1H
NMR (CDCl3, 300 MHz) δ 1.00 (qd, J = 12.4, 3.5 Hz, 1 H), 1.12-1.32 (m, 2
H), 1.37 (dt, J = 13.4, 3.2 Hz, 1 H), 1.80 (dq, J = 13.4, 3.3 Hz, 1 H),
1.92 (br m, 2 H), 2.26 (br d, J = 11.7 Hz, 1 H), 3.51 (s, 3 H), 3.72
(dddd, J = 10.5, 10.5. 4.1, 4.1 Hz, 1 H), 4.28 (tt, J = 12.2, 3.5 Hz, 1
H), 5.19 (s, 2 H), 6.98-7.09 (m, 4 H), 7.09-7.18 (m, 3 H), 7.30 (t, J =
7.4 Hz, 2 H) (OH signal not observed); 13C NMR (CDCl3, 100 MHz) δ 21.9
(t), 30.3 (t), 34.4 (t), 40.7 (t), 56.1 (d), 54.9 (d), 69.5 (q), 94.4
(t), 116.3 (d), 121.6 (d), 125.2 (d), 129.1 (d), 130.8 (d), 131.5 (s),
151.4 (s), 154.2 (s), 156.7 (s); exact mass m/z calcd for C21H25NO5
371.17328, found 371.17418.
