$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM (3-Hydroxybutyl)[4-(methoxymethoxy)phenyl]carbamic Acid Phenyl Ester
(31a). i-Pr2NEt (0.36 mL, 2.06 mmol) was added to a stirred and cooled
(-78 °C ) solution of 31 (385.8 mg, 1.71 mmol) in CH2Cl2 (8 mL). PhOCOCl
(0.26 mL, 2.06 mmol) was then added at a fast dropwise rate, and stirring
was continued for 1 h (Ar atmosphere). The mixture was diluted with
CHCl3, washed with water and brine, dried (MgSO4), and evaporated. Flash
chromatography of the residue over silica, using 1:1 to 2:1 EtOAc-hexane,
gave 31a (543 mg) as a pale yellow oil:
(3-Hydroxybutyl)[4-(methoxymethoxy)phenyl]carbamic Acid Phenyl Ester
(31a), yield 90% FTIR (CH2Cl2 cast) 3433, 2963, 1719, 1594 cm-1; 1H NMR
(CDCl3, 400 MHz) δ 1.24 (d, J = 6.3 Hz, 3 H), 1.56 (br m, 1 H), 1.76 (br
m, 1 H), 2.80 (br s, 1 H), 3.50 (s, 3 H), 3.54 (br m, 1 H), 3.95 (dqd, J
= 9.5, 6.3, 3.2 Hz, 1 H), 4.20 (br m, 1 H), 5.19 (s, 2 H), 7.05-7.10 (m,
4 H), 7.16-7.22 (m, 3 H), 7.33 (t, J = 7.8 Hz, 2 H); 13C NMR (CDCl3, 100
MHz) δ 23.1 (q), 37.3 (t), 48.0 (t), 56.1 (q), 64.1 (q), 94.5 (t), 116.8
(d), 121.5 (d), 125.4 (d), 128.5 (d), 129.2 (d), 134.9 (s), 151.2 (s),
155.3 (s), 156.3 (s); exact mass (electrospray) m/z calcd for C19H23NNaO5
[M + Na] 368.14864, found 368.14690.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
