(ddd, J = 10.0, 5.2, 5.2 Hz, 1 H), 4.31-4.29 (m, 1 H), 3.51 (d, J = 11.2
Hz, 1 H), 3.33 (s, 3 H), 3.13-3.06 (comp, 3 H), 3.01-2.98 (m, 1H),
2.93-2.89 (m, 1H), 2.81-2.77 (m, 1 H), 2.67-2.50 (m, 1H), 2.37 (m, 1 H),
2.17-2.14 (m, 1 H), 1.25 (d, J = 6.8 Hz, 3 H).
